'''Einarth''', an [[Skyrim:Elder|elderly]] [[Skyrim:Priest|priest]], is one of the [[Skyrim:Greybeards|Greybeards]] living at [[Skyrim:High Hrothgar|High Hrothgar]]. He will teach you the second [[SR:Word of Power|word]] of the Unrelenting Force shout. 

Einarth wears a set of [[SR:Greybeard's Robes|Greybeard's robes]] with the matching [[SR:Greybeard's Hood|hood]] and [[SR:Greybeard's Boots|boots]]. He carries a copy of the book ''[[SR:Dwemer History and Culture|Dwemer History and Culture]]'', a bottle of [[SR:Black-Briar Reserve|Black-Briar Reserve]], a [[SR:Horker Tusk|horker tusk]], one sample of [[SR:Juniper Berries|juniper berries]], and three [[SR:Leather Strips|leather strips]].

He knows the following shouts: [[SR:Disarm|Disarm]], [[SR:Dismay|Dismay]], [[SR:Elemental Fury|Elemental Fury]], [[SR:Fire Breath|Fire Breath]], [[SR:Frost Breath|Frost Breath]], [[SR:Ice Form|Ice Form]], [[SR:Unrelenting Force|Unrelenting Force]], and [[Skyrim:Whirlwind Sprint|Whirlwind Sprint]].

